---
/**
 * eVTOL power and signal architecture, drawn from the report's
 * "Hardware Integration and Power Distribution" and "Flight Controller" sections.
 * Nothing here goes beyond what the report describes.
 */
---

<figure class="sysdiag not-prose">
  <div class="sd-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="System diagram, scrolls sideways on small screens">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="sd-title sd-desc" class="sd-svg">
      <title id="sd-title">eVTOL power and signal architecture</title>
      <desc id="sd-desc">
        The LiPo battery feeds a power splitter. The splitter powers the power distribution board and a buck
        converter. The power distribution board powers two ESCs, which drive the two motors, and the flight
        controller. The buck converter powers the servo rail for the two elevon servos. The Pixhawk 6C Mini flight
        controller sends PWM signals to the ESCs and servos, and connects to the GPS over UART, the RC receiver and
        the telemetry radio, which links to Mission Planner on the ground.
      </desc>

      <defs>
        <marker id="sd-ap" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="sd-head-p" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="sd-as" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
          <path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" class="sd-head-s" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- ── Power (solid) ── -->
      <g class="sd-power">
        <path d="M160 218 H200" marker-end="url(#sd-ap)" />
        <path d="M330 205 H350 V138 H370" marker-end="url(#sd-ap)" />
        <path d="M330 231 H350 V312 H370" marker-end="url(#sd-ap)" />
        <path d="M510 124 H530 V52 H560" marker-end="url(#sd-ap)" />
        <path d="M510 152 H545 V195 H560" marker-end="url(#sd-ap)" />
        <path d="M720 52 H790" marker-end="url(#sd-ap)" />
        <path d="M510 326 H525 V418 H870 V389" marker-end="url(#sd-ap)" />
      </g>

      <!-- ── Signals (dashed) ── -->
      <g class="sd-signal">
        <path d="M645 165 V76" marker-end="url(#sd-as)" />
        <path d="M680 245 V367 H790" marker-end="url(#sd-as)" />
        <path d="M790 142 H760 V182 H730" marker-end="url(#sd-as)" />
        <path d="M790 207 H730" marker-end="url(#sd-as)" />
        <path d="M730 228 H760 V272 H790" marker-end="url(#sd-as)" />
      </g>

      <!-- ── Boxes ── -->
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="30" y="190" width="130" height="56" rx="8" /><text x="95" y="214">LiPo battery</text><text x="95" y="232" class="sd-sub">main supply</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="200" y="190" width="130" height="56" rx="8" /><text x="265" y="214">Power splitter</text><text x="265" y="232" class="sd-sub">DC supply</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="370" y="110" width="140" height="56" rx="8" /><text x="440" y="134">Power module</text><text x="440" y="152" class="sd-sub">PDB · PM06</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="370" y="290" width="140" height="56" rx="8" /><text x="440" y="314">Buck converter</text><text x="440" y="332" class="sd-sub">UBEC → servo rail</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="560" y="24" width="160" height="52" rx="8" /><text x="640" y="47">ESC × 2</text><text x="640" y="64" class="sd-sub">motor speed</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="790" y="24" width="170" height="52" rx="8" /><text x="875" y="47">Motor × 2</text><text x="875" y="64" class="sd-sub">AIR 2216, one per wing</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box sd-fc"><rect x="560" y="165" width="170" height="80" rx="10" /><text x="645" y="196">Flight controller</text><text x="645" y="216" class="sd-sub">Pixhawk 6C Mini</text><text x="645" y="233" class="sd-sub">ArduPlane firmware</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="790" y="120" width="170" height="44" rx="8" /><text x="875" y="147">GPS · UART</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="790" y="185" width="170" height="44" rx="8" /><text x="875" y="212">RC receiver</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="790" y="250" width="170" height="44" rx="8" /><text x="875" y="268">Telemetry radio</text><text x="875" y="284" class="sd-sub">↔ Mission Planner</text></g>
      <g class="sd-box"><rect x="790" y="345" width="170" height="44" rx="8" /><text x="875" y="363">Servo × 2</text><text x="875" y="379" class="sd-sub">elevons</text></g>

      <!-- ── Edge labels ── -->
      <text x="652" y="125" class="sd-edge">PWM</text>
      <text x="688" y="330" class="sd-edge">PWM</text>

      <!-- ── Legend ── -->
      <g class="sd-legend" transform="translate(30 30)">
        <path d="M0 6 H34" class="sd-power-l" /><text x="44" y="10">Power</text>
        <path d="M0 30 H34" class="sd-signal-l" /><text x="44" y="34">Signal / data</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="sd-caption">
    Power and signal architecture of the drone, as built. The flight controller sends PWM signals to the ESCs and
    elevon servos, and exchanges data with the GPS, RC receiver and telemetry radio.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sysdiag {
    margin: var(--space-8) 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sd-scroll { overflow-x: auto; padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4) var(--space-2); }
  .sd-scroll:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: -2px; }
  .sd-svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  /* Phones: keep labels legible and let the diagram scroll sideways inside its frame */
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .sd-svg { min-width: 680px; } }

  .sd-box rect { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 4%, transparent); stroke: var(--border-strong); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .sd-box text { fill: var(--text); font: 600 14px var(--font-sans, system-ui); text-anchor: middle; }
  .sd-box text.sd-sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font: 400 11.5px var(--font-mono, ui-monospace); }
  .sd-fc rect { stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, transparent); }

  .sd-power path { fill: none; stroke: var(--cat-energy, #F5B544); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .sd-signal path { fill: none; stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .sd-head-p { fill: var(--cat-energy, #F5B544); }
  .sd-head-s { fill: var(--accent); }
  .sd-edge { fill: var(--text-faint); font: 500 10.5px var(--font-mono, ui-monospace); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }

  .sd-legend text { fill: var(--text-muted); font: 400 12px var(--font-mono, ui-monospace); }
  .sd-power-l { stroke: var(--cat-energy, #F5B544); stroke-width: 2; }
  .sd-signal-l { stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-dasharray: 5 5; }

  .sd-caption {
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
